<title>USA: AmeriSource completes $500 mln credit line.</title>
<headline>AmeriSource completes $500 mln credit line.</headline>
<dateline>MALVERN, Pa. 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>AmeriSource Health Corp said Thursday it had completed a new five-year, $500 million revolving credit facility.</p>
<p>The facility, which replaces an existing line, increases the company's borrowing capacity by $120 million.</p>
<p>AmeriSource said it expects to use the new facility for growth and corporate development activities.</p>
<p>The credit agreement was completed with a bank syndicate led by NationsBank Corp.</p>
